# "Choose one" (CR 700.2): both modes at once, 1 and 2, are refused (Bot2's Ornithopter and Concealing Curtains give both modes a
# target) and mode 1 is chosen. Suplex's 3 damage does not kill the 0/4 Concealing Curtains, but "if that creature would die
# this turn, exile it instead" applies to the whole turn (CR 611.2c, 614.1a): Bot1's Lightning Bolt after it finishes the
# Curtains and it is exiled, not put into Bot2's graveyard.

